+// Tracks supported:
+//   University    - College -> Year -> Term -> Subject
+//   High          - Year -> Term -> Subject
+//   Middle        - Year -> Term -> Subject
+//   Primary       - Year -> Term -> Subject
+//   Featured      - Subject only (no College, no Year/Term)
+//
+// Modes:
